Subject: [PATCH] Profile::GetMesg: model rewrite accepted by the search
 (generation 33)

Provenance: greedy search, seed 2, generation 33, region 574 (Profile::GetMesg).
Generated by the model (deepseek-v4.1-flash); not hand-written. Search-time ratio R (candidate/stock, <1 is faster): 0.8552 -> 0.8548 at acceptance (max of two measurements). This is a ranking value, NOT an independent per-patch
confirmation; only the fixed FINAL patch of the run was re-measured independently.
Cumulative patch it was derived from: runs/deepseek/greedy-s2-1072867/patches/gen_33.patch (diff against stock; do not apply together with the others).
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/fit_profile.cpp | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/fit_profile.cpp b/src/fit_profile.cpp
index dda0365..ef92aa1 100644
--- a/src/fit_profile.cpp
+++ b/src/fit_profile.cpp
@@ -3059,6 +3059,7 @@ const Profile::MESG Profile::mesgs[MESGS] =
 const Profile::MESG* Profile::GetMesg(const FIT_UINT16 num)
 {
     static const Profile::MESG* lookup[65536] = {};
+    static FIT_UINT16 max_num = 0;
     static bool initialized = false;
 
     if (!initialized)
@@ -3068,10 +3069,15 @@ const Profile::MESG* Profile::GetMesg(const FIT_UINT16 num)
             const FIT_UINT16 n = mesgs[i].num;
             if (lookup[n] == NULL)
                 lookup[n] = &mesgs[i];
+            if (n > max_num)
+                max_num = n;
         }
         initialized = true;
     }
 
+    if (num > max_num)
+        return NULL;
+
     return lookup[num];
 }
 
